<h2 id="what-these-are">What these are <a class="heading-anchor" href="#what-these-are" aria-label="Permalink to What these are">#</a></h2>

<p>The Drifter and Eris Morn are independent character agents. Each has its own
voice, guardrails, memory and tests. They are not prompt presets; they are small
repositories you can run in OpenCode, OpenClaw or another app that reads
instructions.</p>

<p>Both read the same Grimoire archive. That is what keeps them from inventing
lore when they answer.</p>

